						 <div class="creditRate"> <div class="rateBox"> <div class="rate-box-with-credit-button"> <div class="creditButton"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>著作信息</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/4" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <p><strong>山高水长</strong></p> <p><strong>发布时间：</strong>2019年7月15日</p> <p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3935168&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607261884" alt="Lyrics Linn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3935168)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" >Lyrics Linn</a></span>，进入<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/lyricslinn-s-personnel-file">人事档案</a>查看该名作者的更多作品</p> <p><strong>中心：</strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/memento-mori-hub">凡人终死竞赛</a>第二轮参赛作品。<br /> 参赛角色为研究员SilverIce，基准作品为<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-349">SCP-CN-349</a>。本故事系列的上一篇作品为<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/melting-symphony">消融的乐章</a>，剧情有承接之处。<br /> 本轮对手为<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ninth-bb" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4370469&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607261884" alt="Ninth BB" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/