margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#604e85, #604e85); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>！！！Infas……？！（（</p> </div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 300px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#604e85, #604e85); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>等等、你为什么会在这里，呃（</p> </div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <p>毕竟SilverIce<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/oasis">上一次</a>看见Infas的时候，后者全程都在拿枪指着他的脑袋。对于一个从基金会叛逃至麦宗的前研究员而言，再次见到自己曾经的搭档实在有些尴尬，他几乎是本能地调出了防御模块。</p> <div style="float:right; width: 300px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style=" font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background-color:#66CCFF; text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>哟，Silver……好久不见啊。</p> </div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 300px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#604e85, #604e85); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>！！好久不见fas，你这是……（（</p> </div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 300px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style=" font-family: Verdana,